--TEST--
A `mixed` `foreach` subject does not compile, because it does not say which loop to run — `rule:iteration/foreach-subjects`
--FILE--
<?nvs
mixed $m = ["a" => 1, "b" => 2];
foreach ($m as tainted string $k => mixed $v) {
    echo $k, "\n";
}
--EXPECT--

--EXPECTF-ERROR--
error[E0443]: `foreach` cannot iterate a `mixed`
  --> case.nvs:3:10
%A
error: aborting due to 1 error
To read what a code means and how to fix it, run `nvs agent show <code>`.
